Round 2 Assen ✅
Race 1: DNF ❌ 
Race 2: P13
-
Overall a tricky but positive weekend at the Cathedral Of Speed. Frustrating to crash out of Race 1, and happy to claw back some points in race 2 after a big mistake on the first lap. Pace is strong, bike is in a great place, just about stringing everything together 💪🏻. 
-
A massive thank you to my @phrperformance team for their hard work this weekend, so thankful for all the graft after some tricky sessions and crashes, always putting in 100% 🙌🏻. 
-
New track to learn at Most in 4 weeks time, looking forward to the challenge 😈. 
